# scripts/ is a Docker build context for scripts/Dockerfile.seed (build-seed.sh)
# and scripts/Dockerfile.seed-check (check-seed.sh). Each build copies just its own
# entrypoint from here; every other seed-builder asset comes from the `helpers=`
# context (deploy/docker). Send the daemon the minimum: exclude everything, then
# re-include the two entrypoints the builds need.
*
!seed-entrypoint.sh
!seed-check-entrypoint.sh
